{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114823","id":3161852282,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc68dgl6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114823","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114823.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114823.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114823","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114823/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114823/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114823/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e9fedcef7c61e885207abed05a1e718d76aecd1b","number":114823,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add editor:// directory to filesystem dock.","user":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A follow-up PR to my **_global plugin_** PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111193. Also related to the second point of my proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/831#issuecomment-3355144722.\r\n\r\nAlso solved the [third feature](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111193#pullrequestreview-3648290048) proposed by @KoBeWi \r\n\r\nThis PR added the `editor://` directory to the filesystem dock. Which can be interacted like the `res://` directory. This is for user to easily develop editor plugins.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"539\" height=\"719\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-23 084725\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f90e455e-f9e1-4a65-95c6-90bb9f5dbb0e\" />\r\n\r\n# Goal\r\nThe goal of this PR is to make creating editor addons **easy**, by adding the editor resource path into the filesystem that can be interacted like the normal project resources.\r\n\r\n# Features\r\n- Resources can be opened, edited, and saved.\r\n- All file right click options work.\r\n- You can move/copy files between `editor://` directory and `res://`.\r\n- `editor://` folder color is permanently gray. (Perhaps a different unique color is better. Like the favorites uses white folder)\r\n- A button to toggle visibility of the editor directory  (Not visible by default) <img width=\"56\" height=\"51\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/861d5bb1-0f68-4f08-8ff8-f9e4dd1b5889\" />. This is needed because the filesystem might look messy, and user will not be using it all the time.\r\n- Filtering work.\r\n- Creating new folders work.\r\n- Creating new resources work.\r\n- Add to favorites is working.\r\n\r\n# TODO\r\n\r\n- [x] Fix `ProjectSettings::localize_path` not implemented correctly.\r\n- [x] ~~Fix errors when moving files to `editor://`~~ Nevermind, that was just a plugin bug.\r\n- [x] Fix freezing when using filesystem dock layout other than the default one.\r\n- [x] Make creating new resources work.\r\n- [x] Make creating new script work.\r\n- [x] Add a button to hide the editor:// folders.\r\n- [x] Make adding to favorites work.\r\n- [x] Fix filesystem not scanning after creating script on `editor://` directory.\r\n- [x] Fix editor:// folder collapsed after filesystem scan.\r\n- [x] Fix filtering `editor://` files in split viewer mode not working properly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-10T10:37:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T14:38:13Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T14:36:57Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"PiCode9560:global-plugin-file-system-display","ref":"global-plugin-file-system-display","repo":{"id":904115207,"node_id":"R_kgDONeO0Bw","name":"godot","full_name":"PiCode9560/godot","owner":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/re